<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Link LeetCode Account</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .dashboard-layout {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Sidebar */
    .sidebar {
      width: 60px;
      background: white;
      border-right: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      padding: 20px 0;
      position: fixed;
      height: 100vh;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .sidebar-icon {
      display: block;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      margin: 10px auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #6c757d;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .sidebar-icon:hover {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      color: #6f42c1;
    }

    .sidebar-icon.active {
      background: #6f42c1;
      color: white;
    }

    .sidebar-icon svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
    }

    /* Main Content */
    .main-content {
      flex: 1;
      margin-left: 60px;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .header p {
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Top Bar */
    .top-bar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      left: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      background: white;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 0 30px;
      z-index: 99;
    }

    .user-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: #6c757d;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .user-avatar {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #6f42c1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Section */
    .section {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section-header {
      padding: 20px 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #6f42c1;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #5a32a3;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #6c757d;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #5a6268;
    }
    
    .step-section {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
    }
    
    .step-section h3 {
      color: #333;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .step-section p {
      color: #6c757d;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .step-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    
    .step-list li {
      color: #6c757d;
      margin: 8px 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .code-block {
      background: #2d3748;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      margin: 15px 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    
    .highlight-box {
      background: #e7f3ff;
      border: 1px solid #b3d9ff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .highlight-box h4 {
      color: #004085;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .highlight-box p {
      color: #004085;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      margin: 10px 10px 10px 0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    
    .btn:hover {
      background: #5a6fd8;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: #667eea;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #6c757d;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #5a6268;
    }
    
    .extension-info {
      background: #fff3cd;
      border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .extension-info h4 {
      color: #856404;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .extension-info p {
      color: #856404;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .warning-box {
      background: #f8d7da;
      border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .warning-box h4 {
      color: #721c24;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .warning-box p {
      color: #721c24;
      margin: 0;
    }
    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .main-content {
        margin-left: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .top-bar {
        left: 0;
      }

      .sidebar {
        transform: translateX(-100%);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="dashboard-layout">
    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <nav class="sidebar">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="sidebar-icon active" title="Dashboard">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M3 13h8V3H3v10zm0 8h8v-6H3v6zm10 0h8V11h-8v10zm0-18v6h8V3h-8z"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/problems" class="sidebar-icon" title="Problems">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/logout" class="sidebar-icon" title="Logout">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M17 7l-1.41 1.41L18.17 11H8v2h10.17l-2.58 2.59L17 17l5-5zM4 5h8V3H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8v-2H4V5z"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Top Bar -->
    <div class="top-bar">
      <div class="user-menu">
        <div class="user-avatar">
          <%= (@user.leetcode_username || @user.email).first.upcase %>
        </div>
        <span><%= @user.leetcode_username || @user.email %></span>
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="main-content" style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Link Your LeetCode Account</h1>
        <p>Follow these steps to connect your LeetCode account and start tracking your progress</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 1: Install the Chrome Extension</h3>
        <p>First, you need to install our Chrome extension to securely link your LeetCode account.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Open Chrome and navigate to <code>chrome://extensions/</code></li>
          <li>Enable "Developer mode" in the top right corner</li>
          <li>Click "Load unpacked" and select the <code>public/chrome-extension</code> folder from this project</li>
          <li>You should see "LeetCode Tracker" appear in your extensions list</li>
        </ol>
        
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <h4>Important</h4>
          <p>Make sure you're using Chrome or a Chromium-based browser for this to work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 2: Log in to LeetCode</h3>
        <p>Ensure you're logged into your LeetCode account before proceeding.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Go to <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank">leetcode.com</a></li>
          <li>Sign in with your LeetCode credentials</li>
          <li>Verify you can see your profile and solved problems</li>
        </ol>
        
        <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Go to LeetCode</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 3: Link Your Account</h3>
        <p>Use the Chrome extension to securely link your LeetCode account.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Click the LeetCode Tracker extension icon in your Chrome toolbar</li>
          <li>Click "Link Account" to connect your LeetCode account</li>
          <li>Your account will be automatically created and linked</li>
          <li>You'll be redirected to your dashboard</li>
        </ol>
        
        <div class="extension-info">
          <h4>Chrome Extension Required</h4>
          <p>The extension securely fetches your LeetCode authentication cookies and sends them to this application to establish the connection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>How It Works</h3>
        <p>Our Chrome extension securely communicates with this application to:</p>
        
        <ul class="step-list">
          <li>Fetch your LeetCode authentication cookies</li>
          <li>Create a secure connection between your LeetCode account and our app</li>
          <li>Sync your profile data, solved problems, and submission history</li>
          <li>Enable real-time progress tracking and note-taking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="warning-box">
        <h4>Security Note</h4>
        <p>Your LeetCode cookies are only sent to this local development server. The extension only requests necessary permissions and doesn't store sensitive data locally. All communication is encrypted and secure.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Need Help?</h3>
        <p>If you encounter any issues during the setup process:</p>
        
        <ul class="step-list">
          <li>Make sure you're logged into LeetCode</li>
          <li>Check that this Rails server is running</li>
          <li>Try refreshing the extension popup</li>
          <li>Check the browser console for error messages</li>
          <li>Ensure the extension is properly loaded in Chrome</li>
        </ul>
        
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

